    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to present 222 Lower Pouladuff Road to the market. This attractive four bedroom semi -detached house is ideally located in the popular and well-established area of The Lough, just minutes from Cork City Centre. The property offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation, making it an ideal family home. Externally, the property benefits from front and rear gardens, a large garage and a separate shed, providing excellent outdoor space and valuable additional storage.\r\n\r\nConveniently located, the property enjoys easy access to a wide range of local amenities and is within walking distance of Cork city centre, Wilton, a number of primary and secondary schools, colleges and hospitals. The South Link Road network is also easily accessible.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, No. 222 benefits from four bus routes operating nearby, providing excellent public transport links to Cork city centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nWith its generous accommodation and convenient location, 222 Lower Pouladuff Road offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a family home in a highly sought-after area of Cork City."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.25m x 4.57m \r\nCarpet flooring, gas fireplace, large window overlooking front of property.\nDouble doors to:\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.25m x 6.07m \r\nTiled Flooring, fitted kitchen including dishwasher, hob, oven and fridge freezer.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Toilet - \r\nGuest Wc & Whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.44m x 2.36m \r\nCarpet Flooring, radiator, built in Wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.52m x 2.81m \r\nCarpet Flooring, window to the rear, radiator. Built in Wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom - \r\nThree Piece Suite\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.29m x 5.64m \r\nCarpet Flooring, radiator, built in Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.74m x 3.39m \r\nCarpet Flooring, radiator, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nLawned garden to front with off street parking, Private garden to the rear. \r\n\r\nShed - 1.72m x 3.21m \r\n\r\n\r\nGarage - 2.51m x 7.9m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
